OL,3,GNEWSAMayor defends record on city
OL,4,Acentre litter
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mayor of Liverpool City Region has
OL,7,Fdefended the cleanliness of the city
OL,8,Fcentre in a radio phone-in after a
OL,9,Fcaller suggested it was "really dirty".
OL,11,FSteve Rotheram was asked if litter and
OL,12,Fdirt were a problem, particularly when
OL,13,Fit came to tourism, during an
OL,14,Fappearance on BBC Radio Merseyside.
OL,16,FHowever, Rotheram said he did not
OL,17,Frecognise the characterisation, adding
OL,18,Fthat the city had improved markedly
OL,19,Fsince travel author Bill Bryson
OL,20,Fdescribed a visit in the 1990s as like
OL,21,F"a festival of litter".
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
