OL,3,GNEWSAMayor defends record on city
OL,4,Acentre litter
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "I'd love him to come with me
OL,7,Fnow. We'd have a walk through Liverpool
OL,8,FOne. I've just done it now and we saw
OL,9,Fone piece of litter in Liverpool One -
OL,10,Fyou hardly see any chewing gum."
